            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, justices asked whether the prosecution may argue the possibility of commutation in a South Carolina capital case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a56afe33ea862db543b1d8f3cd6066e3bd0b04bcd13b98c00488ca17f20add19",
