          ],
          "text": "According to David I. Bruck, david I.\u202fBruck argued that future dangerousness is not easily inferred when the defendant has no prior record and the crime is intrafamilial."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "David I. Bruck",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "a56afe33ea862db543b1d8f3cd6066e3bd0b04bcd13b98c00488ca17f20add19",
              "evidence_ids": [
